{"rule":"lemma-pool/v1","groups":{"aplicar":{"host":"984fbce2","siblings":["5216f496"]}},"rows":{"5216f496":{"word":"aplica","rank":7518,"meanings":[{"headword":"aplicar","pos":"verb","source_reference":"kaikki:en-aplicar-pt-verb-Bn2n6qBs","translation":"to apply (to be relevant to)","context":"+ a"}]}},"examples":{"5216f496":{"m":[[{"t":"O mesmo se aplica a apoiar a Lei de Cuidados de Emergência.","e":"The same goes for sponsoring that Catastrophic Care bill.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.693977,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"f76704496ae815e82def1a5731d084ce","i":"186ed6646a4be768b1dfe23e78c1de13","r":"1137470:6292755:1747:7984","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["1137470","6292755","1747"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"\"Com todo o gosto\" não se aplica aqui, mas... de nada.","e":"\"My pleasure\" wouldn't quite apply here. But... you're welcome.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.760622,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"5831fe95987b1740ba5ad8c4199dfeb6","i":"25de5ba51c7ff8ef4f3a7e6bd16c90ff","r":"5937632:6879768:456:4780347","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5937632","6879768","456"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Não há tempo a perder, o que raramente se aplica à morgue.","e":"There's not a moment to lose, which one can so rarely say of a morgue.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.757948,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"eda1c550d56142877b27d4f866dc8812","i":"324e937d9d51608c856149ca06730d75","r":"3845232:6841566:289:2516467","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["3845232","6841566","289"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Ou será que isso só se aplica quando queres ser honesto comigo?","e":"Or does that only apply when you want to be honest with me?","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.905144,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"fedee428f923ec09d511dc8509d7685a","i":"3b